74:Tec2,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Where can I access GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning)?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) is available through 1 API provider: Novita. Each provider offers different performance characteristics and pricing."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How many API providers offer GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning)?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) is currently available through 1 API provider that we benchmark and track."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which provider is fastest for GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning)?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The fastest provider for GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) by output speed is Novita (46.3 t/s). Output speed measures how quickly tokens are generated after the model starts responding."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which provider has the lowest latency for GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning)?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The provider with the lowest time to first token for GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) is Novita (2.76s). Lower latency means faster initial response time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which provider is cheapest for GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning)?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The most affordable provider for GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) by blended price is Novita ($0.38 per 1M tokens). Blended price uses a 7:2:1 cache hit/input/output token ratio."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which provider has the lowest input price for GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning)?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The provider with the lowest input token pricing for GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) is Novita ($0.60 per 1M input tokens)."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which provider has the lowest output price for GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning)?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The provider with the lowest output token pricing for GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) is Novita ($1.80 per 1M output tokens)."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) providers support JSON mode?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The only provider of GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) supports JSON mode for structured output."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) providers support function calling?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The only provider of GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) supports function calling (tool use)."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which is the best provider for GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning)?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Novita leads across all key metrics for GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning), offering the fastest speed, lowest latency, and most competitive pricing."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I choose a provider for GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning)?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"When choosing a provider for GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning), consider: output speed (for throughput-intensive tasks), latency (for interactive applications requiring quick first responses), pricing (for cost-sensitive workloads), and API features like JSON mode or function calling."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does provider performance for GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) change over time?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, provider performance can vary over time due to infrastructure changes, load balancing, and updates. We continuously benchmark all providers and display historical performance trends in the \"Over Time\" charts."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What are the overall capabilities of GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning)?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"For information about GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning)'s intelligence, capabilities, modalities, and how it compares to other models, see the model overview page."}}]}5b:["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$74"}}]
